  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-11-02T05:06:52.298Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I want to attach PhysBone colliders to things like uneven floors, walls with holes, tabletops, and many other objects!\n\nThere are far more use cases than for avatars, so I believe the demand for this feature is quite high.\n\nja:\n\n段差のある床、穴のある壁、机の天板など、さまざまなオブジェクトにPhysBoneコライダーを付けたいです。\n\nアバターよりもはるかに用途が多く、この機能の需要はかなり高いと思います。",
